{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.MmuR9V9Closure","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierBarParity"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow.order_window","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow.order_window","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MuPCarrierOrderWindow.lean#L99-L140","doc":"**Order window.** Suppose the μ–p correction has the monomial form\n`t = |c| · h^k`, where\n\n* `h = ℏ_q ∈ [0.098, 0.100]` (the substrate at any pin in the legitimate μ–p\n  window; the probe measures `ℏ_{q₀} = 0.09908171604`),\n* `|c| ∈ [1/5, 5]` is a *small-height* coefficient, and\n* `t ∈ [1.8e-7, 2.4e-7]` is the measured residual `209.755 ppb`, a window that\n  comfortably contains `±1σ_exp = ±22 ppb`.\n\nThen `k ∈ {6, 7}`.\n\nOrders `k ≤ 5` give at least `0.098⁵/5 ≈ 1.81e-6`, over 7.5× the top of the\nwindow; orders `k ≥ 8` give at most `5·0.1⁸ = 5e-8`, under 0.28× the bottom.\nBoth are contradictions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow.delta_V9_not_bar_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow.delta_V9_not_bar_even","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MuPCarrierOrderWindow.lean#L89-L95","doc":"**`delta_V9` is not bar-even.** Witness `q = 2`:\n`δ_V9(1/2) = 21/100` but `δ_V9(2) = 21/25600`.\n\nProbe measures `δ_V9(1/q₀)/δ_V9(q₀) = 2.3042`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow.delta_R9_not_bar_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow.delta_R9_not_bar_even","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MuPCarrierOrderWindow.lean#L80-L87","doc":"**`delta_R9` is not bar-even.** Witness `q = 2`:\n`δ_R9(1/2) = 1/10` but `δ_R9(2) = 1/160`.\n\nAt the substrate pin the violation is not marginal — the probe measures\n`δ_R9(1/q₀)/δ_R9(q₀) = 1.5180`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow.hbarGen_eq_hbarQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MuPCarrierOrderWindow.hbarGen_eq_hbarQ","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MuPCarrierOrderWindow.lean#L66-L70","doc":"The generic `ℏ` of `MuPCarrierBarParity` agrees with the production `hbarQ`\non `ℝ`, so the parity results there apply verbatim to the definitions below. ","signatureChunk":0}]}